        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG409-914-630, Contemporary 36\" Satin Stainless Steel Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 36 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Handle is 1-1/4 inches in diameter and has a 24-3/4 inch center to center mount. It has a satin stainless finish, which is arguably the most durable of all since it is resistant to corrosion, scratches, and abrasions. This Modern Stainless steel Door Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG409-914-specifications.gif?v=1704354776\" width=\"558\" height=\"210\" \" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG409-914 Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other lengths: <a href=\"/products/48-inch-long-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-handle-ahi-sig409-1220-630\"><b>48\" Door Handle</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/24-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-handle-ahi-sig409-610-630\"><b>24\" Door Handle</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/14-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-handle-ahi-sig409-355-630\"><b>14\" Door Handle</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the AHI SIG409-914-630 Contemporary Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Length: 36\" (914 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 34-3/4\" (883 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\" (80 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" (32 mm) Round</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG409-914-specifications.pdf?v=1691093352\"><b>AHI SIG409-914 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
