                "description": "The 36 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Handle is 1-1/4 inches in diameter and has a 24-3/4 inch center to center mount. It has a satin stainless finish, which is arguably the most durable of all since it is resistant to corrosion, scratches, and abrasions. This Modern Stainless steel Door Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n",
